  "clinical_uncertainties": [],
  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Right, so, I know I said on the phone it was just the tiredness, but honestly it's more than that now. I just feel flat all the time, and the baby's fine, she's gorgeous, that's what makes it so confusing.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:01",
      "end_timestamp": "00:19",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "The low mood, the low mood has been there about four months. It was worse in the first two months, then a bit better, then worse again when I started thinking about going back to work.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:08",
      "end_timestamp": "01:24",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "So about four months of low mood, in waves, with the worst patch at the beginning and another when work came into view. Is there a time of day it's heaviest?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:26",
      "end_timestamp": "01:41",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Mornings, and evenings when she's unsettled. I'm going to ask a few straight questions, because I ask everybody who has been low. Have you had any thoughts of harming yourself?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:58",
      "end_timestamp": "02:11",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, no, nothing like that. I'd never.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:12",
      "end_timestamp": "02:16",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thank you for telling me. And any thoughts of harming the baby?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:17",
      "end_timestamp": "02:23",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "God, no. I'm terrified of anything happening to her, if anything I check on her too much. I got up four times last night just to see her chest moving.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:24",
      "end_timestamp": "02:37",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's very common, and I'm glad you said it out loud. What about panic attacks, those sudden waves of fear with a racing heart?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:38",
      "end_timestamp": "02:50",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No panic attacks. I get a bit wound up in the supermarket, but nothing like that.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:52",
      "end_timestamp": "03:00",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, sertraline, 100 mg, one every morning with my tea. And the thyroid tablet, the levothyroxine, 75 micrograms, one a day before breakfast. Oh, and the iron, ferrous fumarate, one at night, the pharmacist suggested it.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:17",
      "end_timestamp": "03:36",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, the underactive thyroid, I was nineteen when they found it. And the anaemia, that was in the pregnancy, that's why the iron. I also get migraines now and then, but they've been quiet.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:53",
      "end_timestamp": "04:07",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Underactive thyroid, anaemia, and migraines that have been quiet. Good. Has anyone in your family struggled with their mood?",
      "start_timestamp": "04:10",
      "end_timestamp": "04:18",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "My mum had depression, after I was born actually, nobody called it that back then. She told me last month, which was a surprise. Sorry, that's a tangent.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:20",
      "end_timestamp": "04:34",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Blood pressure is 112 over 70 and your pulse is 84 beats per minute. Both perfectly comfortable numbers.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:08",
      "end_timestamp": "05:19",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Your sister-in-law has a fair point. I can't rule out that your thyroid has drifted off again and is adding to the flatness and tiredness, so we shouldn't put it all down to mood.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:37",
      "end_timestamp": "05:53",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "It was never all in your head. Low mood after a baby is common and treatable, and the thyroid is worth checking either way. I'd like to repeat your thyroid blood test, and I'll arrange it for you to have today.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:02",
      "end_timestamp": "06:23",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Sleep matters hugely here. Could your husband do one night feed so you get a four-hour block? Even a few nights of that can lift things. Does that sound possible?",
      "start_timestamp": "07:01",
      "end_timestamp": "07:15",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Say yes on the weekend, then, and let the housework go. Please also ring us the same day if your mood drops sharply or those thoughts of harming yourself ever appear.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:27",
      "end_timestamp": "07:41",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "You will, and we're going to work on it together. I'd like to see you again in four weeks, once the results are back, and we'll go through them.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:50",
      "end_timestamp": "08:06",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[3]",
        "follow_up[0]"
      ]
    }
